	(text_box "MISC NOTE M2:\n• Bring-up order: these rails before anything digital (R5 in the acceptance table)\n• +5V at C14 = 5.04 +/- 0.1 V, +3V3 at C15 = 3.30 +/- 0.07 V with J3 unplugged\n• U1 +12V now also carries U4 / U5 (~40 mA) and the LED string (~9 mA): check +12V at C4 under load"
